# Fungi tuft 3: seven scarlet elf cups about 0.4 m tall, glossy red bowls open to the sky on short, pale stalks, tilted a little
# this way and that and standing round a mound of humus. Oversized for the forest floor, so the red reads at a distance; the
# counterpart of flower3. They barely sway.
format 1

# Detail as the grass and flowers have it: the fine stalks and thin stems are small next to the model's size
Detail detail=0.91
    Intersection
        Union
            Material material=tuft_soil
                Translate translation=(0, 0, 0)
                    Distort amount=0.008 frequency=12
                        Intersection
